    {
      "id": "64991268-6887-4d0e-85cd-ed95f6ebd5df:revise:1",
      "index": 1,
      "partId": "plants-and-animals-need-each-other",
      "question": {
        "display": "कौन-से जीव अपना खाना खुद बनाते हैं?",
        "audioUrl": "/media/d9d135d75d96eff7be982c51d0b71ffbf2a790fb7867817a369cc3666bfb3591.mp3",
        "audioSha256": "d9d135d75d96eff7be982c51d0b71ffbf2a790fb7867817a369cc3666bfb3591"
      },
      "answer": {
        "display": "सिर्फ़ पौधे। जानवर पौधों का खाना लेते हैं, सीधे या घुमा-फिराकर।",
        "audioUrl": "/media/82db5348501c7eb2d6284b801a433154b7ba28f53fe22b239e3da0853c4fd878.mp3",
        "audioSha256": "82db5348501c7eb2d6284b801a433154b7ba28f53fe22b239e3da0853c4fd878"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "64991268-6887-4d0e-85cd-ed95f6ebd5df:revise:2",
      "index": 2,
      "partId": "plants-and-animals-need-each-other",
      "question": {
        "display": "जानवर और पौधे कौन-कौन सी गैस बाहर छोड़ते हैं?",
        "audioUrl": "/media/161d7960e83dd023c12a87f92c5a1e8e90fdf1add6caee8c76067802210b3885.mp3",
        "audioSha256": "161d7960e83dd023c12a87f92c5a1e8e90fdf1add6caee8c76067802210b3885"
      },
      "answer": {
        "display": "जानवर **carbon dioxide** बाहर छोड़ते हैं और पौधे oxygen बाहर छोड़ते हैं।",
        "audioUrl": "/media/cc070f9f6798b6a372a39de62eb8d0b63079406a032c0b347dc8eaad48164a69.mp3",
        "audioSha256": "cc070f9f6798b6a372a39de62eb8d0b63079406a032c0b347dc8eaad48164a69"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "64991268-6887-4d0e-85cd-ed95f6ebd5df:revise:3",
      "index": 3,
      "partId": "plants-and-animals-need-each-other",
      "question": {
        "display": "जानवर पौधों के लिए क्या ले जाते हैं?",
        "audioUrl": "/media/a310af39387da0a2f92ba21cd218b5872569cf24c6f111542b86430fb64305ed.mp3",
        "audioSha256": "a310af39387da0a2f92ba21cd218b5872569cf24c6f111542b86430fb64305ed"
      },
      "answer": {
        "display": "**Pollen** दूसरे फूलों तक, और seeds नई ज़मीन तक।",
        "audioUrl": "/media/7deb7c9293df65f147d757e9ed36204606525066cd0b3db8c4345b3cafb58ae8.mp3",
        "audioSha256": "7deb7c9293df65f147d757e9ed36204606525066cd0b3db8c4345b3cafb58ae8"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "64991268-6887-4d0e-85cd-ed95f6ebd5df:revise:4",
      "index": 4,
      "partId": "plants-and-animals-need-each-other",
      "question": {
        "display": "Interdependence का मतलब क्या है?",
        "audioUrl": "/media/8e8ea2631426d45dc0ad46e0ae75a29bf1014d3bf4707c5c739b5092d80b0e4a.mp3",
        "audioSha256": "8e8ea2631426d45dc0ad46e0ae75a29bf1014d3bf4707c5c739b5092d80b0e4a"
      },
      "answer": {
        "display": "पौधे और जानवर जीने के लिए एक-दूसरे पर **depend** करते हैं।",
        "audioUrl": "/media/2d69dc7ae3bb28400668e18c35e4446c13a0cfad6d7fdb7d9427344b771a1be6.mp3",
        "audioSha256": "2d69dc7ae3bb28400668e18c35e4446c13a0cfad6d7fdb7d9427344b771a1be6"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "64991268-6887-4d0e-85cd-ed95f6ebd5df:revise:5",
      "index": 5,
      "partId": "omnivores-and-liquid-feeders",
      "question": {
        "display": "किसी जानवर का feeding group किस बात से तय होता है?",
        "audioUrl": "/media/90464d2403870069e2b3fce6891967e4f7147a3d0be82372a78d11bdcdefca53.mp3",
        "audioSha256": "90464d2403870069e2b3fce6891967e4f7147a3d0be82372a78d11bdcdefca53"
      },
      "answer": {
        "display": "सिर्फ़ यह कि वह क्या खाता है, उसका size या डरावनी शक्ल कभी नहीं।",
        "audioUrl": "/media/157b95327a3d26b2b0e6b33131584000e79489567f256a8326fb5f2c4063045d.mp3",
        "audioSha256": "157b95327a3d26b2b0e6b33131584000e79489567f256a8326fb5f2c4063045d"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "64991268-6887-4d0e-85cd-ed95f6ebd5df:revise:6",
      "index": 6,
      "partId": "omnivores-and-liquid-feeders",
      "question": {
        "display": "गाय जैसे herbivores क्या खाते हैं?",
        "audioUrl": "/media/4127a262ef647c53fcb4d71c91bb1d33919fee431b9ecf4afdfa2d2ef235a92b.mp3",
        "audioSha256": "4127a262ef647c53fcb4d71c91bb1d33919fee431b9ecf4afdfa2d2ef235a92b"
      },
      "answer": {
        "display": "सिर्फ़ पौधों का खाना, और कुछ नहीं।",
        "audioUrl": "/media/65219c65571f6dce5ee40a7e7c2e76544ac2fb4e07cd86e44d630ce80ace4605.mp3",
        "audioSha256": "65219c65571f6dce5ee40a7e7c2e76544ac2fb4e07cd86e44d630ce80ace4605"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "64991268-6887-4d0e-85cd-ed95f6ebd5df:revise:7",
      "index": 7,
      "partId": "omnivores-and-liquid-feeders",
      "question": {
        "display": "जानवर के दाँत उसके खाने के हिसाब से कैसे होते हैं?",
        "audioUrl": "/media/1ed0078ce073554b2f0871dc53fe11dca8cd48f9b6b786c4abbd5909fe31b6c5.mp3",
        "audioSha256": "1ed0078ce073554b2f0871dc53fe11dca8cd48f9b6b786c4abbd5909fe31b6c5"
      },
      "answer": {
        "display": "चपटे दाँत घास पीसते हैं, नुकीले दाँत माँस फाड़ते हैं।",
        "audioUrl": "/media/9e21b6753fb0d015f42df079078ccfef0c5886a3757d9aed4feaa8fe2b78dd9a.mp3",
        "audioSha256": "9e21b6753fb0d015f42df079078ccfef0c5886a3757d9aed4feaa8fe2b78dd9a"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "64991268-6887-4d0e-85cd-ed95f6ebd5df:revise:8",
      "index": 8,
      "partId": "omnivores-and-liquid-feeders",
      "question": {
        "display": "Chewing the cud का मतलब क्या है?",
        "audioUrl": "/media/695f419126e46aec89a5f33f64ab246eca7a16cd39a8c4d05c3cb4a956f192be.mp3",
        "audioSha256": "695f419126e46aec89a5f33f64ab246eca7a16cd39a8c4d05c3cb4a956f192be"
      },
      "answer": {
        "display": "गाय घास निगलती है, उसे वापस ऊपर ले आती है, अच्छे से चबाती है, फिर निगल लेती है।",
        "audioUrl": "/media/e122460870e99d246f09be6eb8de7a0248b18ff41b4a5876376cfa26fa7c94f1.mp3",
        "audioSha256": "e122460870e99d246f09be6eb8de7a0248b18ff41b4a5876376cfa26fa7c94f1"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "64991268-6887-4d0e-85cd-ed95f6ebd5df:revise:9",
      "index": 9,
      "partId": "omnivores-and-liquid-feeders",
      "question": {
        "display": "खरगोश और गिलहरी सख़्त nuts कैसे खाते हैं?",
        "audioUrl": "/media/35515003f10138dae96c55066bb7f34f782c59cdb674aec69733c90e3f189cc9.mp3",
        "audioSha256": "35515003f10138dae96c55066bb7f34f782c59cdb674aec69733c90e3f189cc9"
      },
      "answer": {
        "display": "**Gnawing** से, यानी अपने बड़े आगे वाले दाँतों से बार-बार थोड़ा-थोड़ा काटकर।",
        "audioUrl": "/media/998e5170229c5a3cb195ea7d0a0fc380b43bfcc67024e5e10a498854876ecdef.mp3",
        "audioSha256": "998e5170229c5a3cb195ea7d0a0fc380b43bfcc67024e5e10a498854876ecdef"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "64991268-6887-4d0e-85cd-ed95f6ebd5df:revise:10",
      "index": 10,
      "partId": "omnivores-and-liquid-feeders",
      "question": {
        "display": "बाघ जैसे carnivores क्या खाते हैं?",
        "audioUrl": "/media/801785bfa424dea3e8f927b998e866b92afdd01c3e53c4877fc6564f5170a0df.mp3",
        "audioSha256": "801785bfa424dea3e8f927b998e866b92afdd01c3e53c4877fc6564f5170a0df"
      },
      "answer": {
        "display": "**Flesh**, यानी दूसरे जानवरों का माँस।",
        "audioUrl": "/media/2511cfce75461fbb6acba6f18c1e50e53476daa463fff9810058ff5483ae3a8b.mp3",
        "audioSha256": "2511cfce75461fbb6acba6f18c1e50e53476daa463fff9810058ff5483ae3a8b"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "64991268-6887-4d0e-85cd-ed95f6ebd5df:revise:11",
      "index": 11,
      "partId": "omnivores-and-liquid-feeders",
      "question": {
        "display": "साँप अपना prey कैसे खाता है?",
        "audioUrl": "/media/264ef8f480e3a6117030e6013ae7e7f884360294589ce73483bf026235dadeed.mp3",
        "audioSha256": "264ef8f480e3a6117030e6013ae7e7f884360294589ce73483bf026235dadeed"
      },
      "answer": {
        "display": "वह prey को साबुत निगल जाता है, चबाता नहीं; पेट उसे गला देता है।",
        "audioUrl": "/media/f72a805a8d68ce8564deec84775be069643e37dec2e1f76790aa08c9352a4f15.mp3",
        "audioSha256": "f72a805a8d68ce8564deec84775be069643e37dec2e1f76790aa08c9352a4f15"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "64991268-6887-4d0e-85cd-ed95f6ebd5df:revise:12",
      "index": 12,
      "partId": "omnivores-and-liquid-feeders",
      "question": {
        "display": "इंसान जैसे omnivores क्या खाते हैं?",
        "audioUrl": "/media/29c2636ce9f5398d08f3600c9297860997d552c4fd8d370d7b2096fdfa914ba6.mp3",
        "audioSha256": "29c2636ce9f5398d08f3600c9297860997d552c4fd8d370d7b2096fdfa914ba6"
      },
      "answer": {
        "display": "दोनों, पौधों वाला खाना भी और जानवरों वाला खाना भी।",
        "audioUrl": "/media/f029adbf0ad6f396b1a1f31fb6513d50ada9b653a0a91ae7c7089e7a101ef9da.mp3",
        "audioSha256": "f029adbf0ad6f396b1a1f31fb6513d50ada9b653a0a91ae7c7089e7a101ef9da"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "64991268-6887-4d0e-85cd-ed95f6ebd5df:revise:13",
      "index": 13,
      "partId": "omnivores-and-liquid-feeders",
      "question": {
        "display": "तितली या मच्छर खाना कैसे खाते हैं?",
        "audioUrl": "/media/e2f113a7443908538b3bead71c578e9cbc3b97887b6c0eb66bdc95bddc55c3b2.mp3",
        "audioSha256": "e2f113a7443908538b3bead71c578e9cbc3b97887b6c0eb66bdc95bddc55c3b2"
      },
      "answer": {
        "display": "वह एक लंबी, **straw** जैसी नली से liquid food चूस लेता है।",
        "audioUrl": "/media/6f4f57866bec23d058347a971857c5b41d0a1223ed8c3fd7a9e375179fbd6181.mp3",
        "audioSha256": "6f4f57866bec23d058347a971857c5b41d0a1223ed8c3fd7a9e375179fbd6181"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "64991268-6887-4d0e-85cd-ed95f6ebd5df:revise:14",
      "index": 14,
      "partId": "omnivores-and-liquid-feeders",
      "question": {
        "display": "किन बातों से कोई जानवर insect कहलाता है?",
        "audioUrl": "/media/9896481e9f2ed1c5dad10f39beab7653a4a4d9c08e5faccfbf933b8937211d7d.mp3",
        "audioSha256": "9896481e9f2ed1c5dad10f39beab7653a4a4d9c08e5faccfbf933b8937211d7d"
      },
      "answer": {
        "display": "छह टाँगें, शरीर के तीन हिस्से और एक जोड़ी feelers।",
        "audioUrl": "/media/659c1e11a717ffd407e6c809d857fd775ac873a481cdc009368428321925ca48.mp3",
        "audioSha256": "659c1e11a717ffd407e6c809d857fd775ac873a481cdc009368428321925ca48"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "64991268-6887-4d0e-85cd-ed95f6ebd5df:revise:15",
      "index": 15,
      "partId": "food-chains-and-food-webs",
      "question": {
        "display": "Food chain क्या होती है?",
